{
  "_comment": "RAEN client value-ledger config (STACI, Nov 11 2026). value_per_call = $ assigned to one settled call for the client-facing report. hours_per_call = human-hours that task would have cost manually (estimated-hours-saved heuristic).",
  "services": {
